{"answer":{"id":"1994061208941242054","type":"answer","content":"<p data-pid=\"zVQnKShn\">好像有一个大家都没提到的，那就是</p><figure data-size=\"normal\"><noscript><img src=\"https://pica.zhimg.com/50/v2-d13f9dddb762dce596bf970e2571e62c_720w.jpg?source=2c26e567\" data-size=\"normal\" data-rawwidth=\"1280\" data-rawheight=\"720\" data-original-token=\"v2-d13f9dddb762dce596bf970e2571e62c\" class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb\" width=\"1280\" data-original=\"https://pic1.zhimg.com/v2-d13f9dddb762dce596bf970e2571e62c_r.jpg?source=2c26e567\"/></noscript><img src=\"data:image/svg+xml;utf8,&lt;svg xmlns=&#39;http://www.w3.org/2000/svg&#39; width=&#39;1280&#39; height=&#39;720&#39;&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;\" data-size=\"normal\" data-rawwidth=\"1280\" data-rawheight=\"720\" data-original-token=\"v2-d13f9dddb762dce596bf970e2571e62c\" class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb lazy\" width=\"1280\" data-original=\"https://pic1.zhimg.com/v2-d13f9dddb762dce596bf970e2571e62c_r.jpg?source=2c26e567\" data-actualsrc=\"https://pica.zhimg.com/50/v2-d13f9dddb762dce596bf970e2571e62c_720w.jpg?source=2c26e567\"/><figcaption>知乎热榜</figcaption></figure><p data-pid=\"Du-DTetF\">知乎热榜，你可能会觉得奇怪，这也不热啊？</p><p data-pid=\"7aj30Y3s\">没错，因为这就不是真正的热榜。</p><figure data-size=\"normal\"><noscript><img src=\"https://pic1.zhimg.com/50/v2-78dc224261dde704ee8171c4739b38cf_720w.jpg?source=2c26e567\" data-caption=\"\" data-size=\"normal\" data-rawwidth=\"1998\" data-rawheight=\"1074\" data-original-token=\"v2-78dc224261dde704ee8171c4739b38cf\" class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb\" width=\"1998\" data-original=\"https://picx.zhimg.com/v2-78dc224261dde704ee8171c4739b38cf_r.jpg?source=2c26e567\"/></noscript><img src=\"data:image/svg+xml;utf8,&lt;svg xmlns=&#39;http://www.w3.org/2000/svg&#39; width=&#39;1998&#39; height=&#39;1074&#39;&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;\" data-caption=\"\" data-size=\"normal\" data-rawwidth=\"1998\" data-rawheight=\"1074\" data-original-token=\"v2-78dc224261dde704ee8171c4739b38cf\" class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb lazy\" width=\"1998\" data-original=\"https://picx.zhimg.com/v2-78dc224261dde704ee8171c4739b38cf_r.jpg?source=2c26e567\" data-actualsrc=\"https://pic1.zhimg.com/50/v2-78dc224261dde704ee8171c4739b38cf_720w.jpg?source=2c26e567\"/></figure><p data-pid=\"3d_fiOux\">而真正的热榜被隐藏起来了，大部分人不知道。</p><p data-pid=\"rCN58Knp\">那就是：“创作中心”-“等你来答”-“近期热点”</p><p class=\"ztext-empty-paragraph\"><br/></p><p data-pid=\"EqdUR3hl\">不知道这算不算“正确使用知乎”。</p><hr/><p data-pid=\"k1qHG7ua\">26年2月3日，现在创作中心也找不到了近期热点了，但是如果直接访问网址还可以找到，就是下面这个网址：</p><p data-pid=\"TeJL1AZb\"><a href=\"https://www.zhihu.com/knowledge-plan/hot-question/hot/0/day\" class=\"internal\" target=\"_blank\"><span class=\"invisible\">https://www.</span><span class=\"visible\">zhihu.com/knowledge-pla</span><span class=\"invisible\">n/hot-question/hot/0/day</span><span class=\"ellipsis\"></span></a></p><p></p>","createdTime":1768201240,"updatedTime":1770102220,"voteupCount":2878,"commentCount":199,"favlistsCount":3536,"thanksCount":144,"question":{"id":"19550225","title":"如何正确使用知乎？"},"author":{"name":"曹力科","urlToken":"guidaogui","headline":"国家二级文盲","avatarUrl":"https://pica.zhimg.com/c17eb267bd0d165c56414e2adc24b1b8_l.jpg?source=2c26e567"}},"question":{"id":"19550225","title":"如何正确使用知乎？","detail":"<p>2011年，知乎上线，「如何正确使用知乎？」是知乎第一个被提出的问题。</p>","topics":[{"name":"知乎指南"},{"name":"知乎15周年"}]}}
